 "doc": "M4-C12-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch12_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): Cloudloom, the summit temple (colour script ch12: white stone under open sky, no ice anywhere in it, ADR 0015). The stair up from the south (Approach; a ramp), the open-roofed weaving-hall on white stone, rows of keth hanging from its beams with an aisle up the middle, and Hesk's place on the dais at its north end (hesk). Back down to Quellan at to_quellan. The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C12-01).",
